get.description:
Stream music map computation progress via Server-Sent Events.

Sends progress events during computation, then the complete map data.

Event types:
- progress: {"phase": "...", "progress": 0.5, "message": "..."}
- complete: Full MusicMapResponse JSON
- error: {"error": "..."}

delete.description:
Remove a track from a playlist by track_id.

For backwards compatibility. Use DELETE /playlists/{id}/items/{playlist_track_id}
for explicit removal of playlist items (handles both local and external tracks).
